<title>HUNGARY: ERAVIS REPORTS LOSSES FOR H1.</title>
<headline>ERAVIS REPORTS LOSSES FOR H1.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating result	     56.4 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax result		 17.9 loss</p>
<p>    After-tax result	     17.9 loss</p>
<p>    Net sales		     943.7</p>
<p>    Other revenue		  79.8</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales     765.6</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales   177.4</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	  137.0</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 43.4 profit</p>
<p>     Financial revenue	  117.5</p>
<p>     Financial expenditure     74.0</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income    4.9 loss</p>
<p>     Extraordinary revenue    657.6</p>
<p>     Extraordinary expend.    662.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Eravis Szalloda es Vendeglato Rt is a hotel chain. The figures are unaudited and were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards. The company did not provide comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
